## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## Nordic NeTEx Profile — Fares Overlay
## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## ROLE: Extends the Nordic Profile to cover FARES — fare products,
##       fare structure, geographical/usage parameters, and the
##       pricing grid (fare tables). Adds SHACL constraints and
##       canonical element ordering for the fare classes, layered on
##       the generated NeTEx base exactly like netex-nordic.ttl does
##       for network/timetable classes.
##
## SCOPE: The Nordic shared agreement for fares. Only tightens,
##        annotates and orders the generated netex: fare classes —
##        it never mints new terms in the CEN-owned netex: namespace.
##
## SOURCE:
##   - Nordic NeTEx Profile "fares" (Handbook N801), v0.96
##     (last changed 2022-07-28) — long-pending review, captured here
##     as the profile's fares agreement. Class hierarchies, enums and
##     cardinalities below follow that document.
##   - EFIP-style export examples (Innlandstrafikk single ticket;
##     Reis Nordland express-boat distance fare and bus carnet /
##     klippekort). Every shape is grounded in elements that appear
##     in those real exports.
##   - Entur produkt sub-profile (entur-netex-ontology,
##     feat/produkt-fareproducts) — the downstream demonstrator whose
##     PROPOSAL list this overlay realises against the richer base.
##
## Imports:
##   netex.ttl (generated) — CEN-owned NeTEx base ontology (submodule)
##   netex-nordic-vocab.ttl — Nordic-specific vocabulary (nordic:)
##
## Items that the generated base does not yet expose are flagged with
## "## PROPOSAL:" rather than grounded on ungrounded netex: IRIs.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

@prefix netex:   <https://netex-cen.eu/ontology#> .
@prefix nordic:  <https://netex-cen.eu/nordic#> .
@prefix profile: <https://netex-cen.eu/profile#> .
@prefix sh:      <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

## --- Import generated NeTEx base + Nordic vocabulary ---
<https://netex-cen.eu/profile/nordic/fares> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Nordic NeTEx Profile — Fares Overlay" ;
    owl:imports <https://netex-cen.eu/ontology> ,
                <https://netex-cen.eu/nordic> ;
    rdfs:comment "Nordic Profile fares layer: SHACL constraints and element ordering for fare products, fare structure and pricing, grounded in the EFIP export examples and Handbook N801 v0.96." .

## =================================================================
## FARES SUB-PROFILE MARKER
## =================================================================

profile:NP_Fares a nordic:Profile ;
    rdfs:label "Nordic Profile — Fares" ;
    skos:notation "NP-Fares" ;
    skos:definition "Fares part of the shared Nordic NeTEx Profile: fare products, fare structure, usage/geographical parameters and pricing." ;
    nordic:specializes profile:NP ;
    nordic:dataConfidence [
        nordic:level "MEDIUM" ;
        nordic:basis "Handbook N801 fares v0.96 is still awaiting formal review/ratification into the Nordic Profile. Shapes are grounded in real EFIP-style exports (Innlandstrafikk, Reis Nordland) but the fares profile itself is not yet ratified NP." ;
        nordic:datasets "Innlandstrafikk single ticket (zonal); Reis Nordland express-boat distance fare and bus carnet (klippekort)" ;
        nordic:lastValidated "2026-08"
    ] .

## =================================================================
## FARE PRODUCTS — SHACL SHAPES
## =================================================================
## FareProduct < ServiceAccessRight (fares product group). The
## examples carry PreassignedFareProduct (single trip) and
## AmountOfPriceUnitProduct (carnet / klippekort).
## Shape naming: profile:NP_{ClassName}Shape
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

## --- FareProduct (abstract common constraints) ---

profile:NP_FareProductShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:FareProduct ;
    rdfs:label "FareProduct — NP fares constraints" ;
    ## A fare product is always sold under one organisation.
    ## Examples use OperatorRef (which may carry an Authority id).
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:operatorRef ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "OperatorRef" ;
        sh:description "The organisation the product is sold under (OperatorRef/AuthorityRef in the examples)"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:name ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "Name" ;
        sh:description "XSD allows 0..1, NP mandates 1..1"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:chargingMomentType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ChargingMomentType"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:conditionSummary ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ConditionSummary"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:productType ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ProductType" ;
        sh:description "Product classification (examples use singleTrip, tripCarnet)"
    ] .

## --- PreassignedFareProduct (single trip) ---

profile:NP_PreassignedFareProductShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:PreassignedFareProduct ;
    rdfs:label "PreassignedFareProduct — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:validableElements ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:name "validableElements" ;
        sh:description "The validable elements bundling the fare structure this product grants access to"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:accessRightsInProduct ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:name "accessRightsInProduct" ;
        sh:description "Access rights (→ ValidableElementRef) carried by the product"
    ] .

## --- AmountOfPriceUnitProduct (carnet / klippekort) ---

profile:NP_AmountOfPriceUnitProductShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:AmountOfPriceUnitProduct ;
    rdfs:label "AmountOfPriceUnitProduct — NP fares constraints" ;
    ## Carnet products state the quota (e.g. 10 klipp) in Amount.
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:amount ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "Amount" ;
        sh:description "Number of units in the carnet (e.g. 10 for a 10-trip klippekort)"
    ] .

## --- ConditionSummary (inline product summary) ---

profile:NP_ConditionSummaryShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:ConditionSummary ;
    rdfs:label "ConditionSummary — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:fareStructureType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "FareStructureType" ;
        sh:description "Examples use pointToPointDistanceFare, zonalFare"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:isRefundable ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "IsRefundable"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:isExchangable ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "IsExchangable"
    ] .

## --- AccessRightInProduct ---

profile:NP_AccessRightInProductShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:AccessRightInProduct ;
    rdfs:label "AccessRightInProduct — NP fares constraints" ;
    ## Each access right resolves to exactly one validable element.
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:validableElementRef ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:class netex:ValidableElement ;
        sh:name "ValidableElementRef" ;
        sh:description "The validable element this access right grants"
    ] .

## =================================================================
## FARE STRUCTURE — SHACL SHAPES
## =================================================================
## FareStructureElement < PriceableObject carries the geographical
## intervals and the GenericParameterAssignments (validity params).
## ValidableElement < PriceableObject bundles FareStructureElements.
##
## GPA PLACEMENT — two export variants exist (both seen in examples):
##   (A) EFIP-style: each GenericParameterAssignment is wrapped in its
##       own FareStructureElement, referenced via FareStructureElementRef.
##   (B) Inline: GenericParameterAssignments sit directly under
##       validityParameterAssignments on the FSE / product / element.
## The shapes below constrain the logical objects and do not assume a
## placement, so both exports validate against the same rules.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

## --- FareStructureElement ---

profile:NP_FareStructureElementShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:FareStructureElement ;
    rdfs:label "FareStructureElement — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:name ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "Name"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:tariffBasis ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "TariffBasis" ;
        sh:description "Examples use distance, zone"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:geographicalIntervals ;
        sh:name "geographicalIntervals" ;
        sh:description "Distance/zone bands priced by the fare table"
    ] .

## --- ValidableElement ---

profile:NP_ValidableElementShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:ValidableElement ;
    rdfs:label "ValidableElement — NP fares constraints" ;
    ## A validable element bundles at least one fare structure element.
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:fareStructureElements ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:name "fareStructureElements" ;
        sh:description "The fare structure elements (via FareStructureElementRef) that make up this validable element"
    ] .

## --- GenericParameterAssignment ---

profile:NP_GenericParameterAssignmentShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:GenericParameterAssignment ;
    rdfs:label "GenericParameterAssignment — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:validityParameterAssignmentType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ValidityParameterAssignmentType" ;
        sh:description "EQ in the examples"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:limitationGroupingType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "LimitationGroupingType"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:validityParameterGroupingType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ValidityParameterGroupingType"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:chargingBasis ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ChargingBasis" ;
        sh:description "normalFare in the examples"
    ] .

## =================================================================
## FARE COMPONENTS (geographical / time factors) — SHACL SHAPES
## =================================================================

## --- GeographicalInterval ---
## GeographicalInterval < FareStructureFactor < PriceableObject

profile:NP_GeographicalIntervalShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:GeographicalInterval ;
    rdfs:label "GeographicalInterval — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:startGeographicalValue ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;
        sh:name "StartGeographicalValue"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:endGeographicalValue ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;
        sh:name "EndGeographicalValue"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:numberOfUnits ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:integer ;
        sh:name "NumberOfUnits"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:intervalType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "IntervalType" ;
        sh:description "Classification of interval type" ;
        sh:in ( "coupon" "distance" "section" "stop" "tariffZone" "tariffUnit" )
    ] .

## --- TimeInterval ---
## TimeInterval < FareInterval < PriceableObject

profile:NP_TimeIntervalShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:TimeInterval ;
    rdfs:label "TimeInterval — NP fares constraints" ;
    ## Duration is the defining, mandatory element of a TimeInterval.
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:duration ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:duration ;
        sh:name "Duration"
    ] .

## =================================================================
## USAGE PARAMETERS — SHACL SHAPES
## =================================================================
## All UsageParameter < ValidityParameter. The examples exercise
## UserProfile, CompanionProfile, Refunding, PurchaseWindow,
## UsageValidityPeriod, FrequencyOfUse and Interchanging.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

## --- UserProfile ---

profile:NP_UserProfileShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:UserProfile ;
    rdfs:label "UserProfile — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:name ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "Name" ;
        sh:description "XSD allows 0..1, NP mandates 1..1 (e.g. Adult, Child, Senior, Student)"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:userType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "UserType"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:minimumAge ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:integer ;
        sh:name "MinimumAge"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:maximumAge ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:integer ;
        sh:name "MaximumAge"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:proofRequired ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ProofRequired"
    ] .

## --- CompanionProfile ---

profile:NP_CompanionProfileShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:CompanionProfile ;
    rdfs:label "CompanionProfile — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:userProfileRef ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "UserProfileRef"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:discountBasis ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "DiscountBasis"
    ] .

## --- FrequencyOfUse ---

profile:NP_FrequencyOfUseShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:FrequencyOfUse ;
    rdfs:label "FrequencyOfUse — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:frequencyOfUseType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "FrequencyOfUseType" ;
        sh:description "unlimited in the examples"
    ] .

## --- UsageValidityPeriod ---

profile:NP_UsageValidityPeriodShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:UsageValidityPeriod ;
    rdfs:label "UsageValidityPeriod — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:validityPeriodType ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "ValidityPeriodType"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:usageTrigger ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "UsageTrigger"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:usageEnd ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "UsageEnd"
    ] .

## =================================================================
## PRICING (fare tables) — SHACL SHAPES
## =================================================================
## FareTable holds the price grid; Cell carries a CellPrice plus the
## PriceableObjectRefs (product × user profile × geographical interval)
## the price applies to.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

## --- FareTable ---

profile:NP_FareTableShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:FareTable ;
    rdfs:label "FareTable — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:pricesFor ;
        sh:name "pricesFor" ;
        sh:description "The priceable object(s) this table prices (product / fare structure element)"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:cells ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:name "cells" ;
        sh:description "The priced cells of the grid"
    ] .

## --- Cell ---

profile:NP_CellShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:Cell ;
    rdfs:label "Cell — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:priceableObjectRef ;
        sh:minCount 1 ;
        sh:name "PriceableObjectRef" ;
        sh:description "The coordinates of the cell (fare structure element × user profile × geographical interval)"
    ] .

## --- FarePrice / CellPrice (Amount + Currency) ---

profile:NP_FarePriceShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:FarePrice ;
    rdfs:label "FarePrice — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:amount ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;
        sh:name "Amount"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:currency ;
        sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "Currency" ;
        sh:description "NOK in the examples"
    ] .

## --- TypeOfPricingRule (VAT / tax category) ---

profile:NP_TypeOfPricingRuleShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass netex:TypeOfPricingRule ;
    rdfs:label "TypeOfPricingRule — NP fares constraints" ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path netex:name ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "Name"
    ] , [
        sh:path netex:taxCategory ;
        sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:name "TaxCategory" ;
        sh:description "e.g. transportation (transport VAT)"
    ] .

## =================================================================
## ELEMENT ORDERING (XSD-derived, confirmed against the examples)
## =================================================================
## Canonical element sequence per fare class. Attributes (@id,
## @version, @order) are listed first by convention. Only elements
## documented in the profile / present in the EFIP examples are listed.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

netex:PreassignedFareProduct nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "validityConditions"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "Name"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "Description"
] , [
    nordic:position 6 ; nordic:element "ChargingMomentType"
] , [
    nordic:position 7 ; nordic:element "OperatorRef"
] , [
    nordic:position 8 ; nordic:element "ConditionSummary"
] , [
    nordic:position 9 ; nordic:element "validityParameterAssignments"
] , [
    nordic:position 10 ; nordic:element "validableElements"
] , [
    nordic:position 11 ; nordic:element "accessRightsInProduct"
] , [
    nordic:position 12 ; nordic:element "ProductType"
] .

netex:AmountOfPriceUnitProduct nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "validityConditions"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "Name"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "Description"
] , [
    nordic:position 6 ; nordic:element "ChargingMomentType"
] , [
    nordic:position 7 ; nordic:element "OperatorRef"
] , [
    nordic:position 8 ; nordic:element "ConditionSummary"
] , [
    nordic:position 9 ; nordic:element "validityParameterAssignments"
] , [
    nordic:position 10 ; nordic:element "validableElements"
] , [
    nordic:position 11 ; nordic:element "accessRightsInProduct"
] , [
    nordic:position 12 ; nordic:element "ProductType"
] , [
    ## XSD: AmountOfPriceUnitProduct adds Amount after the product group
    nordic:position 13 ; nordic:element "Amount"
] .

netex:FareStructureElement nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "validityConditions"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "Name"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "Description"
] , [
    nordic:position 6 ; nordic:element "TariffBasis"
] , [
    nordic:position 7 ; nordic:element "geographicalIntervals"
] , [
    nordic:position 8 ; nordic:element "validityParameterAssignments"
] .

netex:GeographicalInterval nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "StartGeographicalValue"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "EndGeographicalValue"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "NumberOfUnits"
] , [
    nordic:position 6 ; nordic:element "IntervalType"
] , [
    nordic:position 7 ; nordic:element "prices"
] .

netex:GenericParameterAssignment nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "ChargingBasis"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "LimitationGroupingType"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "limitations"
] , [
    nordic:position 6 ; nordic:element "ValidityParameterAssignmentType"
] , [
    nordic:position 7 ; nordic:element "ValidityParameterGroupingType"
] , [
    nordic:position 8 ; nordic:element "validityParameters"
] , [
    nordic:position 9 ; nordic:element "IncludesGroupingType"
] .

netex:ValidableElement nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "validityConditions"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "Name"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "Description"
] , [
    nordic:position 6 ; nordic:element "fareStructureElements"
] , [
    nordic:position 7 ; nordic:element "validityParameterAssignments"
] .

netex:AccessRightInProduct nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "validityConditions"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "ValidableElementRef"
] .

netex:UserProfile nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "validityConditions"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "Name"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "Description"
] , [
    nordic:position 6 ; nordic:element "BaseUserProfileRef"
] , [
    nordic:position 7 ; nordic:element "UserType"
] , [
    nordic:position 8 ; nordic:element "MinimumAge"
] , [
    nordic:position 9 ; nordic:element "MaximumAge"
] , [
    nordic:position 10 ; nordic:element "ProofRequired"
] .

netex:FareTable nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "validityConditions"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "pricesFor"
] , [
    nordic:position 5 ; nordic:element "cells"
] .

netex:Cell nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "CellPrice"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "PriceableObjectRef"
] .

netex:TypeOfPricingRule nordic:elementOrder [
    nordic:position 1 ; nordic:element "@id"
] , [
    nordic:position 2 ; nordic:element "@version"
] , [
    nordic:position 3 ; nordic:element "Name"
] , [
    nordic:position 4 ; nordic:element "TaxCategory"
] .

## =================================================================
## PROPOSAL — fares vocabulary not confirmed in the generated base
## =================================================================
## The following Handbook N801 v0.96 fare objects are needed by richer
## exports but are only added here if the generated base actually
## exposes them. Where the base does not yet project a class, add it to
## the base first (mechanical XSD projection), then move it up into a
## grounded shape above — do NOT mint ungrounded netex: IRIs.
##
## PROPOSAL: additional fare-structure factors (Fare components group):
##   - GeographicalUnit          < FareUnit          (Distance, prices)
##   - GeographicalStructureFactor < FareStructureFactor
##   - QualityStructureFactor    < FareStructureFactor
##   - FareDemandFactor          < QualityStructureFactor
##       (FareDemandType enum: peak middle offPeak superOffPeak night specialEvent)
##   - FareQuotaFactor           < QualityStructureFactor  (NumberOfUnits 1:1)
##   - StartTimeAtStopPoint      < VersionedChild
##       ScheduledStopPointRef 1:1 → ScheduledStopPoint  (hard route-data tie)
##   - DistanceMatrixElement     < PriceableObject
##       (point-to-point / zone-to-zone fares; Distance, IsDirect, RelativeRanking)
##
## PROPOSAL: remaining usage parameters (all UsageParameter < ValidityParameter):
##   Refunding, PurchaseWindow, Interchanging, Reserving, RoundTrip,
##   LuggageAllowance, Suspending, Cancelling, Transferability,
##   Reselling, Exchanging, Replacing, ChargingPolicy, PenaltyPolicy,
##   Subscribing, GroupTicket, CommercialProfile, OnboardValidity.
##   (Refunding, PurchaseWindow, Interchanging already appear in the
##    example limitations — promote to grounded shapes once confirmed
##    in the base.)
##
## PROPOSAL: sales offer + distribution (out of scope of the current
##   examples but part of the fares handbook):
##   SalesOfferPackage, GroupOfSalesOfferPackages, DistributionChannel,
##   FulfilmentMethod, TypeOfTravelDocument, DistributionAssignment.
##
## PROPOSAL: pricing detail objects (Pricing group):
##   FareStructureElementPrice, CellPrice, GeographicalIntervalPrice,
##   PriceGroup, PricingParameterSet, Rounding.
##
## PROPOSAL: route-data dependencies to formalise once a real Nordic
##   fares export exists (candidates for stricter cross-references):
##     - GeographicalInterval[IntervalType=tariffZone] → FareZone
##     - FareZone.members → ScheduledStopPoint      (fare geography ↔ stops)
##     - StartTimeAtStopPoint → ScheduledStopPointRef  1:1
##     - AuthorityRef / OperatorRef → Organisation   (central registry)
##     - product / ValidableElement → TransportSubmode / Line (service scope)
##   Because current export ids are partly synthetic (e.g. NOR:FareZone:*,
##   INN:Authority:INN_ID), tighten these to hard sh:class / existence
##   checks only after products are produced against resolvable data.

## =================================================================
## END OF FARES OVERLAY
